              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kolap lokitomonet kaarei, ŋes elap Adar, kapaaranike nakitomonet kauni, naabu koapunitor aicorakinet naka ekabaka ka ekekisil aitodolikinio, kapaaran naamunotor lukasurup luka Iyudayan ayait kes; kwabo abu kilocokin abuburiar kes, koyaitos Iyudayan ŋul lukelaito kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
